ws others and  they are often surrounded by many people  and ding ding ding it may not be quite  as specific as hisoka's previous  definitions but everything about  specialization fits beyond perfectly he  is absurdly charismatic and despite  being alone actor he is always  surrounded by people in fact he's  surrounded by an entire empire currently  so according to hisoka specialization  would be beyond's best fit however we do  have another system which is furykov's  criteria of affinity analysis via  witnessing the ten of others and sadly  since we have not witnessed the ten of  beyond there's only so much we can do  here however there is one very relevant  aspect to examine which is furykov's  definition of enhancers and transmuters  according to him they have a very soft  quiet ten which does play very well with  the idea of beyond's extremely quiet  aura in general although if we were to  take takashi's promo artwork into  account then beyond may also fit  furykov's conjuration definition which  is having a strong aura surrounding a  dominant part of their body with a  gentle flow everywhere else and this  image definitely contains a strong  dominant flow within that very handy  sector so what is beyond's net affinity  well something we can exclude  immediately is a mission there isn't a  single piece of evidence that makes that  path worthy of consideration and despite  the aforementioned statement about  conjuration that also feels equally as  unlikely there are just too many clashes  of personality traits and i'm not going  to place any bets based on promo artwork  i'm also going to eliminate  transmutation not so much because it's  impossible or even unlikely but simply  because the three remaining affinities  fit beyond significantly better but now  we're in a difficult spot because i  think that you can make a solid argument  for enhancement manipulation and  specialization but i'm also going to  drop manipulation out of the running  because on a surface 